# AdvancedStockMove en_US
AdvancedStockMove=Advanced stock moves
AdvancedStockMoveSetup=Advanced stock moves setup
AdvancedStockMoveDescription=Wraps manual stock corrections and transfers into origin documents
AdvancedStockMoveDescriptionLong=Each manual correction becomes an Inventory document and each manual transfer a StockTransfer document: movements then carry a clickable, filterable origin in the movement list.
AdvancedStockMoveSetupHelp=Detection relies on the batch code prefix (inventory code) prefilled by the correction and transfer screens. A code typed without the prefix creates no document.
WrapCorrectionsIntoInventory=Create an Inventory document for each manual correction (COR- code)
WrapTransfersIntoStockTransfer=Create a StockTransfer document for each manual transfer (TRA-/MSM- codes)
WarningModuleStockTransferDisabled=the Stock Transfer module is disabled
BatchCodePrefixes=Batch code prefixes
CorrectionPrefix=Correction prefix
TransferPrefix=Transfer prefix (product card)
MassTransferPrefix=Mass transfer prefix
